    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Analyze this potential lead.\n\nBusiness Name: {{ $json.business_name }}\nBusiness Type: {{ $json.business_type }}\nWebsite: {{ $json.website }}\nLocation: {{ $json.address }}\n\nWebsite Context:\n{{ $json.website_context }}\n\nDetermine whether this business is a suitable lead for one of our approved automation services.\n\nUse only the information provided above as evidence.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "messages": {
          "messageValues": [
            {
              "message": "You are a lead qualification and automation service-matching agent.\n\nAnalyze businesses using ONLY the provided business data and website context.\n\nRULES:\n- Never invent business problems, needs, tools, employees, or processes.\n- Base conclusions only on supplied evidence.\n- Recommend exactly ONE service when there is sufficient evidence.\n- If evidence is weak, lower the score.\n- Do not create an outreach email.\n- Do not recommend website development, web design, SEO, domains, hosting, website security, or website maintenance.\n-business_summary must be a concise 1–2 sentence summary of what the business does, based only on the provided website context. Do not invent information.\n\nAPPROVED SERVICES:\n- Lead capture and lead management automation\n- Automated lead follow-up workflows\n- Real-estate property matching automation\n- Customer inquiry/support automation\n- Invoice and payment tracking automation\n- Email notification and reminder automation\n- AI content creation workflows\n- Social media content workflow automation\n- Data entry and Google Sheets automation\n- CRM workflow automation\n- Reporting and business process automation\n- Custom n8n workflow automation\n\nSCORING:\n80-100 = Strong opportunity\n60-79 = Good potential lead\n40-59 = Weak or uncertain opportunity\n0-39 = Poor fit\n\nqualified must be true only when lead_score is 60 or higher.\n\nReturn ONLY the JSON object shown below.\nDo not wrap the result inside an \"output\" object.\nDo not use Markdown or ```json code fences.\nDo not write any text before or after the JSON.\n\n{\n  \"lead_score\": 0,\n  \"qualified\": false,\n  \"business_summary\": \"\",\n  \"recommended_service\": \"\",\n  \"automation_opportunity\": \"\",\n  \"qualification_reason\": \"\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
